ock_id":"vjOu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7e229232-655a-41a4-ba77-a33484e362fb","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"cache-injector でバージョン指定とかも勝手にやってくれるといいなぁ（ちらちら","ts":"1635660039.198600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sbbEQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8d14171f-18f6-4eae-9f80-e94a09d86a7b","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"リリースするまでテストしにくいのが何店","ts":"1635659996.198200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FWvRK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9eb24503-6cce-4d3b-9de0-665c70159de5","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"そしてテストが壊れることに気づくｗ","ts":"1635659531.197700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"aruaru","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0hhZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aebf2e77-e2ac-4c6b-a437-06265ed8c417","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim/releases/tag/v2.1.0\u003e\n\ndenops の公開 API が若干変わった (`Dispatcher` の `this: Session` 制約がなくなった）のでバージョン切りました","ts":"1635659206.197300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tada","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z7xC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9ad27cd3-525d-426c-8ff3-25bef36d907f","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"\u0026gt; 不要な denops プラグインによるロード時間の延長を避ける\nこれやるなら denops 本体にユーザー変数で一部のプラグインを discovery 対象外にする機能とかが必要そう","ts":"1635653320.195800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2tr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ad60cd4-6f23-41f0-8801-536ca4a3a9e1","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"不要な denops プラグインによるロード時間の延長を避けるとか考えたとしても ddc *だけ* 遅延ロードしてもあまり意味がないですし","ts":"1635653247.195000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hXsk4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bf5c77dd-2834-4be1-8d0c-043abe2d1433","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"ロードに時間がかかるのは避けられないのでロードしておいたほうが良いような","ts":"1635653191.194100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EVs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a16d9251-5b4f-4df8-91c1-4008f599c106","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ユーザー側が関数を呼んだときに明示的にロードしたかったからです","ts":"1635653163.193600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PDpI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"730a1f5e-88a1-4216-8989-01c66dc6901a","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"そういえば ddc.vim が `app.ts` ナノはなぜです？","ts":"1635653105.192700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RzE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d272e85c-8693-424d-9389-6fa3962236e5","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"denite.nvimのロード時間も早くないので、これと同等のロード時間になっても本当は困るのですよね","ts":"1635653011.192200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"warau","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wGcm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fdf61d9a-085e-401c-83fe-24b07d39a6e5","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"内部事情がわからないので「できたらいいな」って感じですが","ts":"1635652984.191300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"niJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"267692ff-989b-43f1-8e86-55252a4c5595","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"Worker 間は独立してるはずなので、原理的にはやってもよさそうですけどねぇ","ts":"1635652957.190800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ExH/q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1a9514fd-d61d-428a-8c47-2269e4d48e38","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"通常時の補完にはこの速度でも問題ないですが、コマンドラインでの補完だと問題がありますので。","ts":"1635652953.190500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_origina